    "title": "Thornton Man Indicted for Online Threats to Kill Police, FBI Agents - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ian Harper ,\n1 days ago A federal grand jury in Colorado has indicted 40-year-old Kevin Lee Tompkins of Thornton on four counts of making interstate threats to kill federal, state, and local law enforcement officers. The indictment also accuses Tompkins of illegally possessing ammunition despite a prior felony conviction that legally bars him from owning firearms or ammunition. Read full article",
